      "x": 470,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 185,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "wait",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "3. 玩家进入时若插件尚未结清，暂存玩家；每个回调递减计数。",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 185,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "roster",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "4. 就绪后选择 Roster → 本地预设 → Experience 默认编队。",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 185,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "slot",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "5. 先创建各 CharacterSlot，基础属性和 AbilitySet 就绪。",
      "x": 970,
      "y": 610,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "avatar",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "6. 再创建 Pawn、注入 Slot ASC、Possess 出战成员。",
      "x": 1470,
      "y": 610,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "1"
    }
  ],
